ssification":"likely-prompt","value":"head tilts toward the subject right shoulder","occurrences":[{"line":313,"column":13,"kind":"string-literal","functionName":null,"raw":"head tilts toward the subject right shoulder"}]},{"id":"text-00b44f7fe21ec0065948","classification":"likely-prompt","value":"Create one complete FACS ACTION UNITS reference sheet as a flat 7x7 contact sheet, 49 equal portrait tiles. Use a portrait 3:4 or 4:5 canvas; 9:16 is acceptable only if the 7x7 board fills the image. No perspective, no rounded cards, no decorative frames, no thick white gutters, no outer margin, no watermark, no logo. Use thin dark separators or no visible gutters. Each cell must contain one centered medium close-up portrait in the upper 75% of the cell, with a small readable AU code and name in a narrow bottom label band. Subject lock: ","occurrences":[{"line":681,"column":18,"kind":"string-literal","functionName":"buildCompactFACSBoardPrompt","raw":"Create one complete FACS ACTION UNITS reference sheet as a flat 7x7 contact sheet, 49 equal portrait tiles. Use a portrait 3:4 or 4:5 canvas; 9:16 is acceptable only if the 7x7 board fills the image. No perspective, no rounded cards, no decorative frames, no thick white gutters, no outer margin, no watermark, no logo. Use thin dark separators or no visible gutters. Each cell must contain one centered medium close-up portrait in the upper 75% of the cell, with a small readable AU code and name in a narrow bottom label band. Subject lock: "}]},{"id":"text-0622cd1987a014cff87b","classification":"likely-prompt","value":"</div><div class=\"card-actions\"><button class=\"mini\" data-action=\"story\" type=\"button\">Send Story</button><button class=\"mini\" data-action=\"motion\" type=\"button\">Send Motion</button><button class=\"mini\" data-action=\"copy\" type=\"button\">Copy</button></div><button class=\"reference-cover\" data-refselect=\"","occurrences":[{"line":800,"column":408,"kind":"string-literal","functionName":"render","