"<h2>Create Full FACS Board</h2><p>Best pipe: generate a flat 7x7 contact sheet in portrait <strong>3:4 or 4:5</strong>. 9:16 also works if the board fills the image and is not floating in a big empty poster.</p><p>Ask for: 49 equal cells, thin dark separators or no gutters, no thick white grid lines, no outer margin, one centered portrait per cell, labels kept in a narrow bottom band, same lens/crop/light/background across all tiles. Import that final board here; the app crops inside each cell and ignores the label band.</p><p>Important gaze lock: AU61 must look to <strong>image-left / viewer-left</strong>; AU62 must look to <strong>image-right / viewer-right</strong>. They must be visibly opposite, never mirrored into the same direction.</p>","occurrences":[{"line":414,"column":17,"kind":"string-literal","functionName":"showFullFACSInfo","raw":"<h2>Create Full FACS Board</h2><p>Best pipe: generate a flat 7x7 contact sheet in portrait <strong>3:4 or 4:5</strong>. 9:16 also works if the board fills the image and is not floating in a big empty poster.</p><p>Ask for: 49 equal cells, thin dark separators or no gutters, no thick white grid lines, no outer margin, one centered portrait per cell, labels kept in a narrow bottom band, same lens/crop/light/background across all tiles. Import that final board here; the app crops inside each cell and ignores the label band.</p><p>Important gaze lock: AU61 must look to <strong>image-left / viewer-left</strong>; AU62 must look to <strong>image-right / viewer-right</strong>. They must be visibly opposite, never mirrored into the same direction.</p>"}]},{"id":"text-980aa8af0a886684ad84","classification":"likely-prompt","value":"49 facial action buttons with stylized expression heads, real-time prompt output and direct send to BZ Board.","occurrences":[{"line":137,"column":29,"kind":"html-text","functionName":null,"raw":"49 facial action buttons with stylized expression heads, real-time prompt output and direct send to BZ Board."}]